==English==

===Suffix===
'''-z'''

# (''[[urban]] slang'') Used as a substitute for [[-s]] in marking the plural of nouns. Usually used in words in which the [[-s]] suffix is actually pronounced "z".
#: ''boyz'' ''dogz''

